flowchart TD
    SD["store.data"] --> PARSE{parse ok?}
    PARSE -->|yes| EMIT["emit value"]
    PARSE -->|corrupt| CH["CorruptionHandler: default"]
    PARSE -->|IOException| CATCH["catch: emit default"]
    CH --> EMIT
    CATCH --> EMIT
    ED["edit/updateData"] --> WRITE{write ok?}
    WRITE -->|yes| COMMIT["commit + emit"]
    WRITE -->|disk full| KEEP["keep old + surface error"]
